      "text": "CONTENT: conclusion, claim-level citations, uncertainty, method, and premium access boundary. ACTIONS: open cited span; export; open receipt. RESPONSIVE: paper becomes one column; keep conclusion and uncertainty before long claim lists; export controls stay reachable by keyboard.",
